# This repo is pure deploy output: everything here must be committed so that
# `git pull` on each client subdomain gets a complete site.
#
# The previous list ignored fonts/, styles/ui-grid.* and six images/*. That made
# sense under grunt, which emitted content-hashed copies (images/book-library.d72ef8e4.png)
# alongside the plain-named sources, so only the hashed ones belonged in the deploy.
# Vite serves images/ verbatim from app/public/, so the plain names ARE the deploy
# artifacts now -- keeping those entries silently blocked images/book-library-2.png
# and images/book-library-back-2.png, both referenced by views/.

.DS_Store
